  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe \"Green Edge Experimental\" pushes creative boundaries with a strong greenish tint that dominates the color palette. Shadows are dark and dramatic, while mid-tones carry a distinct cool-green overlay, giving the image an avant-garde flair. Skin tones are muted and cool, blending seamlessly with the surreal aesthetic. Bold blues and greens add a punch of color, enhancing the edgy, artistic vibe. This look is perfect for experimental photography, giving a surreal, edgy world.\n\nWhen using this recipe, we recommend setting [Active D-Lighting] to [Extra high] or [Extra high 1] on your camera. Selecting either of these options preserves details in highlights while achieving rich, cinema-like tonal gradations in your image.",
